OL,3,GNEWSAShops given three-month shutdown
OL,4,Aorders after probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo convenience stores in north
OL,7,FLiverpool face being stripped of their
OL,8,Fpremises licences after being shut down
OL,9,Fby the courts.
OL,11,FClosure orders have been issued by
OL,12,Fmagistrates on shops in Norris Green
OL,13,Fand Old Swan following investigations
OL,14,Fby Liverpool Council's Trading
OL,15,FStandards teams.
OL,17,FA business on Utting Avenue was shut
OL,18,Fdown over underage vape sales, and
OL,19,Fillegal cigarettes and tobacco.
OL,21,FA similar order was made for the Old
OL,22,FSwan Off Licence on Prescot Road.
